Icon set for the link page
==========================

Source: Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), npm package "simple-icons".
Version: 16.35.0 for every icon except linkedin.svg, which comes from version
13.21.0 because newer releases no longer include it.
License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication).

Changes made: each file keeps only its <path> element. The <title> element and
role attribute were removed. Nothing else was edited.

email.svg and link.svg are original generic glyphs drawn for this project and
are released under the same CC0 1.0 terms.

The brand marks shown here remain trademarks of their respective owners. They
are included only to identify the matching account or service, and their
presence does not imply endorsement.

The icons are drawn with CSS mask-image, so they take the page's text color.
No icon file is fetched from any other host.

bitcoin.svg, ethereum.svg, merch.svg, monero.svg and solana.svg are copies of
the files in media/icons/ in this repository with the role attribute and the
<title> element removed, so they pass the SVG allowlist in
site/assetcheck.py. merch.svg is an original generic glyph.
